boethius-foreknowledge.logic.r3: argue/scope: P1 (S2): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, foresees ∧ undeceivable → □comes_to_pass, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(foresees ∧ undeceivable → comes_to_pass), C1 (S3) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
